WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.497 --> 00:00:17.139
Monkey splashed through the waterfall and landed in a large cave.

2
00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:21.300
His eyes opened wide.

3
00:00:22.201 --> 00:00:26.082
The cave was filled with bamboo, trees, and beautiful flowers.

4
00:00:27.743 --> 00:00:29.084
Moss covered the walls.

5
00:00:31.336 --> 00:00:35.859
A stream flowed through the cave, and glowing light and mist filled the air.

6
00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:41.742
Monkey found a long table with bowls, cups, and plates.

7
00:00:42.762 --> 00:00:44.764
A fireplace sat against one wall.

8
00:00:47.045 --> 00:00:50.807
Deeper in the cave, Monkey found bedrooms with cozy beds.

9
00:00:52.288 --> 00:00:55.890
Outside, the other monkeys and apes were looking at the waterfall.

10
00:00:55.910 --> 00:00:58.351
“Do you think he made it through?”

11
00:00:58.751 --> 00:00:59.592
asked one monkey.

12
00:01:00.740 --> 00:01:02.542
“No,” said another monkey.

13
00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:06.585
“He probably got washed away down the river.”

14
00:01:08.287 --> 00:01:09.868
Suddenly— splash!

15
00:01:10.929 --> 00:01:14.252
Monkey shot out of the waterfall and landed in front of the group.

16
00:01:14.272 --> 00:01:17.655
“You’re alive!”

17
00:01:18.035 --> 00:01:18.756
said a monkey.

18
00:01:19.597 --> 00:01:20.397
Monkey laughed.

19
00:01:21.778 --> 00:01:23.820
“Yes! And we are very lucky!

20
00:01:24.981 --> 00:01:26.723
I found a perfect home for all of us.

21
00:01:27.443 --> 00:01:27.944
Follow me!”

22
00:01:29.564 --> 00:01:31.505
Monkey jumped back through the water.

23
00:01:33.306 --> 00:01:35.047
Some of the monkeys scratched their heads.

24
00:01:35.067 --> 00:01:39.390
“It still looks dangerous,” said one monkey.

25
00:01:39.410 --> 00:01:42.571
“Let’s go,” said the gibbon.

26
00:01:43.532 --> 00:01:45.073
He leaped through the waterfall.

27
00:01:46.213 --> 00:01:48.374
After that, another monkey jumped through.

28
00:01:50.996 --> 00:01:52.957
Then some more jumped.

29
00:01:55.398 --> 00:01:58.100
Soon all of the monkeys and apes were in the cave.

30
00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:01.922
Everyone ran around to see all the wonderful things.

31
00:02:04.204 --> 00:02:06.265
“This cave is beautiful,” said the gibbon.

32
00:02:07.286 --> 00:02:10.088
Some of the monkeys and apes began fighting and arguing.

33
00:02:11.229 --> 00:02:13.530
They grabbed plates and bowls from one another.

34
00:02:14.631 --> 00:02:16.192
Others fought over the bedrooms.

35
00:02:16.212 --> 00:02:19.314
“I saw this bed first!”

36
00:02:19.614 --> 00:02:20.495
yelled one monkey.

37
00:02:20.515 --> 00:02:23.397
“No!” yelled another monkey.

38
00:02:23.417 --> 00:02:24.458
“I did!”

39
00:02:25.538 --> 00:02:29.041
Monkey watched his friends for a moment and then folded his arms.

40
00:02:29.061 --> 00:02:31.683
“Ahem!” he called.

41
00:02:32.704 --> 00:02:34.886
All the monkeys and apes stopped what they were doing.

42
00:02:35.847 --> 00:02:36.908
They looked at Monkey.

43
00:02:36.928 --> 00:02:40.571
“I found this cave for us,” said Monkey.

44
00:02:40.591 --> 00:02:43.153
“That means I am now your king.

45
00:02:43.493 --> 00:02:44.554
Why aren’t you bowing to me?”

46
00:02:44.574 --> 00:02:47.316
“He’s right,” said the gibbon.

47
00:02:48.277 --> 00:02:51.840
He bowed to Monkey and said, “All hail the Monkey King.”

48
00:02:53.141 --> 00:02:54.402
Everyone else bowed too.

49
00:02:54.422 --> 00:02:57.985
“All hail the Monkey King!”

50
00:02:58.285 --> 00:02:58.985
they shouted.

51
00:03:03.968 --> 00:03:05.229
Many years went by.

52
00:03:06.389 --> 00:03:09.911
During the day the monkeys and apes played in the forest and the stream.

53
00:03:10.952 --> 00:03:13.553
And every night they slept safely in their cave.

54
00:03:15.534 --> 00:03:18.196
One night the monkeys and apes had a huge feast.

55
00:03:19.256 --> 00:03:21.137
Fruits and nuts covered the table.

56
00:03:22.178 --> 00:03:25.560
Monkeys and apes danced and sang while music played.

57
00:03:26.716 --> 00:03:28.917
Monkey sat on his throne and smiled.

58
00:03:29.838 --> 00:03:31.519
But then his smile faded.

59
00:03:32.259 --> 00:03:33.400
Soon he was frowning.

60
00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:36.241
The gibbon saw Monkey and rushed over.

61
00:03:36.261 --> 00:03:40.904
“Your Majesty,” said the gibbon.

62
00:03:40.924 --> 00:03:42.605
“You look sad.

63
00:03:43.065 --> 00:03:43.645
What’s wrong?”

64
00:03:45.466 --> 00:03:46.327
Monkey sighed.

65
00:03:46.347 --> 00:03:48.308
“Our life here is perfect.”

66
00:03:48.328 --> 00:03:51.169
“Yes, that’s true,” said the gibbon.

67
00:03:51.189 --> 00:03:53.050
“So why are you sad?”

68
00:03:54.111 --> 00:03:55.712
Monkey was quiet for a moment.

69
00:03:56.756 --> 00:03:59.197
Then he said, “Someday our lives will end.

70
00:03:59.918 --> 00:04:01.819
I wish this perfect life could last forever.”

71
00:04:02.779 --> 00:04:04.000
The gibbon’s eyes lit up.

72
00:04:05.121 --> 00:04:06.061
“Oh,” he said.

73
00:04:06.081 --> 00:04:07.962
“You want to live forever?”

74
00:04:07.982 --> 00:04:10.344
“I do,” said Monkey.

75
00:04:11.444 --> 00:04:12.725
The gibbon rubbed his chin.

76
00:04:12.745 --> 00:04:15.647
“Then you must study with a sage.

77
00:04:16.807 --> 00:04:18.388
Sages are very wise people.

78
00:04:20.309 --> 00:04:22.210
They can turn themselves into other animals.

79
00:04:23.311 --> 00:04:24.852
They can fly through the sky.

80
00:04:26.036 --> 00:04:27.597
And they know how to live forever.”

81
00:04:29.798 --> 00:04:31.118
Monkey smiled again.

82
00:04:31.138 --> 00:04:33.479
“Where can I find a sage?”

83
00:04:33.799 --> 00:04:34.300
he asked.

84
00:04:34.320 --> 00:04:38.021
“You must find a land with people,” said the gibbon.

85
00:04:38.041 --> 00:04:40.502
“That’s where you’ll find a sage.”

86
00:04:42.643 --> 00:04:46.465
The next morning Monkey built a raft and loaded food onto it.

87
00:04:48.726 --> 00:04:51.347
He pushed the raft into the stream and jumped on.

88
00:04:52.647 --> 00:04:56.588
As the raft began to float away, Monkey waved to his friends.

89
00:04:56.608 --> 00:04:58.533
“Don’t worry!”

90
00:04:58.774 --> 00:04:59.255
he called.

91
00:04:59.275 --> 00:05:02.583
“After I learn how to live forever, I will return!”
